# Soft front-end access gate for the shared preview link.
# When set, the app shows a password screen before it loads.
# When empty/unset, the gate is disabled (normal local dev).
# NOTE: this is client-side only — a first privacy layer, not real security.
# Vite inlines this at BUILD time, so it must be set when the bundle is built.
VITE_ACCESS_PASSWORD=
